  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 144 ÷ 12 + 6 × 3 - 14 = 8\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 6 × 3 - 14 = 8 ⇒ 144 ÷ 12 × 6 + 3 - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**144 ÷ 12**__ × 6 + 3 - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**12 ×**____** 6**__ + 3 - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**72**____** + 3**__ - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __75____** - 14**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 61 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 6 × 3 - 14 = 8 ⇒ 144 × 12 + 6 ÷ 3 - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ 144 × 12 + __**6 **____**÷**____** 3**__ - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**144 ×**____** 12**__ + 2 - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**1728 + 2**__ - 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __1730____** - 14**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 1716 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) − and ×\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 6 × 3 - 14 = 8 ⇒ 144 ÷ 12 + 6 - 3 × 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**144 ÷ 12**__ + 6 - 3 × 14 = 8\n\n⇒ 12 + 6 - __**3 **____**×**____** 14**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**12 + 6**__ - 42 = 8\n\n⇒ __18** - 42**__ = 8\n\n⇒ -24 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) − and +\n\n144 ÷ 12 + 6 × 3 - 14 = 8 ⇒ 144 ÷ 12 - 6 × 3 + 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**144 ÷ 12**__ - 6 × 3 + 14 = 8\n\n⇒ 12 - __**6 × 3**__ + 14 = 8\n\n⇒ __**12 + 14**__ - 18 = 8\n\n⇒ __26** - 18**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 8 = 8 (LHS = LHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
